==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 4.33~8 seconds<sup>130f~240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 4.33~8 seconds<sup>130f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Send out a few [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]] to stall the enemies. Meanwhile, upgrade the [[Worker Cat]] to max level and wait for your money to build up. Once the Worker Cat is at max level, spawn [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cats]] and [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cats]] with meatshields. Your cats should quickly destroy the enemy base, saving you all the trouble of fighting Jackie Peng and Baa Baa.

