==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Ishikawa Prefecture'''.
*The monstrous baseball player on Ishikawa Prefecture's base is a reference to [[wikipedia:Hideki Matsui|Hideki "Godzilla" Matsui]], a former professional baseball player from Neagari, Ishikawa. The monster's pose is exactly the same as the one Matsui is shown in on his Wikipedia article.
*Monaco's base references the [[wikipedia:Circuit de Monaco|Circuit de Monaco]], which is annually used for circuit races such as The Formula One Monaco Grand Prix.

